{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/aimikoda/status/2106044483863191748","id":"2106044483863191748","text":"Seedance 2.5 Prompt Drop\n\nI'm sharing the prompts for this video and my previous two videos below.\n\nThe effect is called the frame-break effect. The character overlaps the black bars at the top and bottom, creating the illusion of popping out of the screen. I tried it with Seedance 2.0 before but never quite got the result I wanted, so I decided to give it another shot with Seedance 2.5.\n\nGetting the bar sizes right is still tricky. The model seems to decide for itself. I tried specifying percentages, but the proportions still varied between generations. Camera movement can also make the bars move or change shape, while stronger instructions to keep them fixed can sometimes break the pop-out effect itself.\n\nI'd like to experiment more but this feels good enough to share, and I don't want to burn through more credits. 😅\n\nIf you try these prompts, remember to customize them for your own characters. And if you find a better way to control the effect, please share it with me too!\n\nThanks for all the interest!","raw_text":{"text":"Seedance 2.5 Prompt Drop\n\nI'm sharing the prompts for this video and my previous two videos below.\n\nThe effect is called the frame-break effect. The character overlaps the black bars at the top and bottom, creating the illusion of popping out of the screen. I tried it with Seedance 2.0 before but never quite got the result I wanted, so I decided to give it another shot with Seedance 2.5.\n\nGetting the bar sizes right is still tricky. The model seems to decide for itself. I tried specifying percentages, but the proportions still varied between generations. Camera movement can also make the bars move or change shape, while stronger instructions to keep them fixed can sometimes break the pop-out effect itself.\n\nI'd like to experiment more but this feels good enough to share, and I don't want to burn through more credits. 😅\n\nIf you try these prompts, remember to customize them for your own characters. And if you find a better way to control the effect, please share it with me too!\n\nThanks for all the interest!","display_text_range":[0,1021],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[274,297],"id":"2106044251872067585","display":"pic.x.com/Ygm2ibXdYD","original":"https://t.co/Ygm2ibXdYD","replacement":"https://x.com/aimikoda/status/2106044483863191748/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"aimikoda","url":"https://x.com/aimikoda","id":"1780124030785204224","followers":31904,"following":490,"likes":24877,"media_count":1158,"name":"Kōda","description":"Creative Technologist. Sharing ideas, prompts, workflows and things I craft.","raw_description":{"text":"Creative Technologist. Sharing ideas, prompts, workflows and things I craft.","facets":[]},"location":"aiverse","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1780124030785204224/1790793875","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105370789683879936/uRffy6XD_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Apr 16 06:40:25 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":67,"retweets":175,"likes":1587,"bookmarks":1533,"quotes":42,"created_at":"Fri Oct 02 15:31:48 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790955108,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":101401,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"id":"2106044251872067585","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2106044251872067585/vid/avc1/2560x1440/ZA5lXl41VdMBZfZk.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106044251872067585/img/bMdFPshq7sNHiuNj.jpg","duration":30.066,"width":2560,"height":1440,"format":"video/mp4","type":"video","formats":[{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2106044251872067585/pl/a6uJ4ZjVb-qRIi2o.m3u8?tag=29&v=cfc","container":"m3u8"},{"url":"https: